{"seq":1,"slug":"assets-liabilities","title":"资产与负债核算","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/financial-accounting/assets-liabilities","wordCount":1422,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"资产与负债核算\">资产与负债核算</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>资产和负债是企业财务状况的两大核心组成部分。资产代表企业拥有的经济资源，负债代表企业承担的偿还义务。准确核算资产和负债，是编制资产负债表的前提，也是企业管理者判断偿债能力和资源配置的数据基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"货币资金核算\">货币资金核算</h3><p>货币资金包括库存现金、银行存款和其他货币资金三类，是流动性最强的资产。</p>\n<p><strong>库存现金管理</strong>：</p>\n<p>企业的库存现金有严格的使用范围限制——只能用于小额零星支付（通常单笔不超过1,000元）。出纳员负责日常管理，实行日清月结。</p>\n<p>常见分录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"提取现金备用：&#10;  借：库存现金    2,000&#10;    贷：银行存款    2,000&#10;&#10;用现金支付办公用品：&#10;  借：管理费用    500&#10;    贷：库存现金    500\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>提取现金备用：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：库存现金    2,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：银行存款    2,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>用现金支付办公用品：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：管理费用    500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：库存现金    500</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>银行存款核算</strong>：</p>\n<p>企业大部分收付通过银行转账完成。月末需编制<strong>银行存款余额调节表</strong>来处理未达账项：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>企业账面余额</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>银行已收企业未收</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>银行已付企业未付</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>银行对账单余额</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>企业已收银行未收</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>企业已付银行未付</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{企业账面余额} + \\text{银行已收企业未收} - \\text{银行已付企业未付} = \\text{银行对账单余额} + \\text{企业已收银行未收} - \\text{企业已付银行未付}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">企业账面余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">银行已收企业未收</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">银行已付企业未付</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">银行对账单余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">企业已收银行未收</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">企业已付银行未付</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>调节后余额相等说明双方记录正确，未达账项待后续正常入账。</p>\n<h3 id=\"应收账款与坏账准备\">应收账款与坏账准备</h3><p>应收账款是企业赊销商品或提供劳务后应向客户收取的款项。</p>\n<p><strong>坏账准备的计提</strong>：</p>\n<p>由于部分客户可能无法付款，企业需要预估潜在损失：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>当期应计提坏账准备</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>应收账款期末余额</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>坏账准备计提比例</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>坏账准备已有贷方余额</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{当期应计提坏账准备} = \\text{应收账款期末余额} \\times \\text{坏账准备计提比例} - \\text{坏账准备已有贷方余额}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当期应计提坏账准备</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">应收账款期末余额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">坏账准备计提比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">坏账准备已有贷方余额</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>常用方法为<strong>余额百分比法</strong>（如按应收账款余额的5%计提）和<strong>账龄分析法</strong>（账龄越长比例越高）。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"计提坏账准备：&#10;  借：信用减值损失    10,000&#10;    贷：坏账准备        10,000&#10;&#10;确认坏账（经批准核销）：&#10;  借：坏账准备    5,000&#10;    贷：应收账款    5,000&#10;&#10;已核销坏账又收回：&#10;  借：应收账款    5,000&#10;    贷：坏账准备    5,000&#10;  借：银行存款    5,000&#10;    贷：应收账款    5,000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>计提坏账准备：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：信用减值损失    10,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：坏账准备        10,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>确认坏账（经批准核销）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：坏账准备    5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：应收账款    5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>已核销坏账又收回：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：应收账款    5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：坏账准备    5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：银行存款    5,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：应收账款    5,000</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"存货计价方法\">存货计价方法</h3><p>存货是企业持有的准备出售的产品、在生产过程中的在产品、以及将在生产或服务中消耗的物料。存货的入账按实际成本，发出时需要选择计价方法。</p>\n<p><strong>先进先出法（FIFO）</strong>：</p>\n<p>假设先购入的存货先发出。物价上涨时，发出成本偏低，期末存货价值偏高，利润偏高。</p>\n<p><strong>加权平均法</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>加权平均单价</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>期初结存金额</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>本期购入金额</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>期初结存数量</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>本期购入数量</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{加权平均单价} = \\frac{\\text{期初结存金额} + \\text{本期购入金额}}{\\text{期初结存数量} + \\text{本期购入数量}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加权平均单价</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1297em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初结存数量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本期购入数量</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">期初结存金额</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">本期购入金额</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>计算简便，适合品种多、收发频繁的企业。结果介于FIFO和LIFO之间。</p>\n<p><strong>示例对比</strong>：</p>\n<p>某商品期初库存100件×10元，本月购入200件×12元，本月销出150件：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>发出成本</th>\n<th>期末库存</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>先进先出法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>100</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1,600</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">100 \\times 10 + 50 \\times 12 = 1{,}600</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">600</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1,800</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150 \\times 12 = 1{,}800</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">800</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加权平均法</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1,000</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2,400</mn></mrow><mn>300</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11.33</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1,700</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150 \\times \\frac{1{,}000+2{,}400}{300} = 150 \\times 11.33 = 1{,}700</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2422em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8972em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">300</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.4461em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">000</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">400</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>150</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>11.33</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1,700</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">150 \\times 11.33 = 1{,}700</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">150</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">11.33</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span><span class=\"mord\">700</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"流动负债核算\">流动负债核算</h3><p><strong>短期借款</strong>：向银行借入的一年内到期的借款。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"借入时：&#10;  借：银行存款    100,000&#10;    贷：短期借款    100,000&#10;&#10;月末计提利息（年利率6%）：&#10;  借：财务费用    500&#10;    贷：应付利息    500&#10;    （$100{,}000 \\times 6\\% \\div 12 = 500$）&#10;&#10;到期归还本息：&#10;  借：短期借款    100,000&#10;      应付利息    3,000&#10;    贷：银行存款    103,000\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>借入时：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：银行存款    100,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：短期借款    100,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>月末计提利息（年利率6%）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：财务费用    500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：应付利息    500</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    （$100{,}000 \\times 6\\% \\div 12 = 500$）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>到期归还本息：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：短期借款    100,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      应付利息    3,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：银行存款    103,000</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>应付账款</strong>：企业购买商品或接受服务时暂未支付的款项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"赊购材料：&#10;  借：原材料      20,000&#10;      应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  2,600&#10;    贷：应付账款    22,600&#10;&#10;付款（享受现金折扣 2%）：&#10;  借：应付账款    22,600&#10;    贷：银行存款    22,148&#10;        财务费用      452\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>赊购材料：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：原材料      20,000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      应交税费—应交增值税（进项税额）  2,600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：应付账款    22,600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>付款（享受现金折扣 2%）：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  借：应付账款    22,600</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    贷：银行存款    22,148</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        财务费用      452</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"资产减值与期末计价\">资产减值与期末计价</h3><p>资产负债表日，企业需评估资产是否存在减值。存货按照&quot;成本与可变现净值孰低&quot;计量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>存货跌价准备</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>成本</mtext><mo>−</mo><mtext>可变现净值（当成本</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mtext>可变现净值时）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{存货跌价准备} = \\text{成本} - \\text{可变现净值}（\\text{当成本} &gt; \\text{可变现净值时}）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">存货跌价准备</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可变现净值</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">当成本</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可变现净值时</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这体现了会计的谨慎性原则——不高估资产、不低估负债。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年的企业资金管理呈现&quot;银企直联&quot;深度整合趋势。通过API接口，企业ERP系统与银行系统实时互通，银行收付款信息秒级同步到企业账簿，传统的月末对账工作量大幅减少。AI驱动的应收账款管理系统能根据客户的付款历史、经营状况自动调整信用额度和账龄风险评级。</p>\n<p>供应链金融的发展也改变了应付账款的管理模式：核心企业的应付账款可以通过区块链平台实现多级流转，使上游中小供应商更快获得融资。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>某企业6月银行存款账面余额 85,000 元，银行对账单余额 92,000 元。经核对发现：①企业已收到转账支票 10,000 元尚未送存银行；②银行代扣水电费 3,000 元企业未记账。编制余额调节表验证双方记录是否一致。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>A公司应收账款期末余额 500,000 元，坏账准备账户已有贷方余额 8,000 元，公司按5%计提坏账准备。计算当期应补提的坏账准备金额并编制分录。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>某商品期初库存200件×15元，3月5日购入300件×16元，3月20日销出350件。分别用先进先出法和加权平均法计算发出成本和期末库存价值。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>思考题：如果物价持续上涨，采用先进先出法和加权平均法分别会对企业的利润和税负产生什么影响？企业在选择计价方法时需要考虑哪些因素？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本节覆盖了企业最核心的资产和负债项目核算。货币资金管理强调安全性和日清月结，应收账款需要通过坏账准备体现谨慎性原则，存货计价方法的选择直接影响利润和税负，流动负债核算则关注利息费用的正确归属。这些业务构成了会计日常工作的主体，需要在理解原理的基础上反复练习分录编制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"资产与负债核算","id":"资产与负债核算"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"货币资金核算","id":"货币资金核算"},{"level":3,"text":"应收账款与坏账准备","id":"应收账款与坏账准备"},{"level":3,"text":"存货计价方法","id":"存货计价方法"},{"level":3,"text":"流动负债核算","id":"流动负债核算"},{"level":3,"text":"资产减值与期末计价","id":"资产减值与期末计价"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"会计凭证与账簿","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/accounting-fundamentals/accounting-vouchers-books"},"next":{"title":"收入费用与利润","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/accounting/financial-accounting/revenue-expense-profit"}}